  "notes": {
    "n1": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "maxH": 840,
      "size": 24,
      "text": "Flow rules\n\n1. Home state is driven by purifier count: 0 = empty state with Add device; 1 = full TDS dashboard; 2+ = list, tap a card for detail.\n\n2. Show data only after the PURIFIER confirms it reached the cloud and sent a reading, not when the BLE write succeeds.\n\n3. Multiple purifiers nearby: list shows a short ID + signal; Identify beeps and blinks the LED. Grey out already-provisioned units.\n\n4. Wi-Fi list comes from the purifier's own scan (so 5 GHz can be flagged). Failure keeps BLE open to retry without re-scanning.\n\n5. Provisioning timeout ~60 s, then show the failure screen with the reason the purifier reported.\n\n6. TDS: purified-water TDS is the hero number. Input TDS only if the hardware has an inlet sensor. Say 'Within range', never 'Safe to drink': TDS doesn't detect bacteria or heavy metals.\n\n7. Profile holds account, alert settings and support. There is no separate Settings tab.",
      "w": 560,
      "x": 1880,
      "y": 1300
    },
